{% comment %}
The hosted Python transform reads custom fields and returns display-ready data.
API credentials (fr24_api_token, flightaware_api_key) never enter rendered markup.
Paid-provider requests only run when their credentials are present, within a
shared time budget; ADSB.lol is already fetched by polling before the transform.
provider_order and max_age_minutes control selection. location_label and
map_up_bearing_deg become the display label and normalized scope fields.
{% endcomment %}
